  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCHA ERF for AFG CAP 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OCHA ERF f&#xf6;r AFG enl CAP 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida st&#xf6;dde som f&#xf6;rsta givare en fond f&#xf6;r sm&#xe4;rre snabba humanit&#xe4;ra    &#xe4;ndam&#xe5;l i Afghanistan under 2010. Ett par givare tillst&#xf6;tte under     &#xe5;ret. Detta &#xe4;r ett forts&#xe4;ttningst&#xf6;d till fonden som har anv&#xe4;nts v&#xe4;l.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden as first donor contributed to the Emergency Response Fund      under OCHA in Afghanistan 2010. This is a continuatin of the support, as the Fund was well used last year.It is a quick and practical fund  mostly used by local NGOs.</narrative>
  </description>
